{comment: Verse 1}
[D]Welcome into this [Em/D]place
[D/Gb]Welcome into His [A]broken ve[G]ssels
You de[D/Gb]sire to abide
In the [B7]praises of Your people
So we [G]lift our [D/Gb]hands
And we [G]lift our [D/Gb]hearts
As we [G]offer up this [A]praise
Unto [A/Db]Your name[D]

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]Creation declares [Em/D]Your glory
[D/Gb]The universe pro[A]claims Your [G]majesty
Yet You [D/Gb]choose to abide
In the [B7]praises of Your people
So we [G]lift our [D/Gb]hands
And we [G]lift our [D/Gb]hearts
As we [G]offer up this [A]praise
Unto [A/Db]Your name[D]
